WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.346 --> 00:00:02.267
When booking isn't reliable,

2
00:00:02.317 --> 00:00:04.924
even interested customers can disappear.

3
00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:07.796
I first test the actual booking page and

4
00:00:07.846 --> 00:00:09.190
calendar availability,

5
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.148
then trace the confirmation and reminder actions.

6
00:00:12.198 --> 00:00:13.891
I verify reschedules,

7
00:00:13.941 --> 00:00:16.824
cancellations, and CRM updates,

8
00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:19.421
so the next step stays clear for everyone.

9
00:00:21.346 --> 00:00:23.183
The result is a booking process that's

10
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:25.984
easier to use, easier to monitor,

11
00:00:26.034 --> 00:00:27.824
and easier to fix.

